{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are humanities new hope, sent out alone to the farthest reaches of outer space in order to build a warp gate that will pave the way to the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/01.gif?t=1746754530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/Salvage_1.png?t=1746754530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a lone engineer find, extract, move and utilize the abundant resources of a massive asteroid to build for humanity\u2019s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft basic tools and equipment from rocks and ice, and advance through the asteroid to get even stronger minerals to build better machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your workflow through automation and maximize your production. Building supply roads and assembly lines will help your resources reach your base faster and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/03.gif?t=1746754530\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/zerog_1.png?t=1746754530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All mining and logistics happen while utilizing zero-G newtonian physics. Bring order into the chaos of space by applying the laws of physics to work in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the laser and vacuum to break rocks and collect resources manually, or create huge automation highways back to your base with drones and accelerators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/02.gif?t=1746754530\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/problem_1.png?t=1746754530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every success brings new challenges with it that have to be overcome. Higher output demands smarter logistics, and every solution is a new opportunity to tinker, optimize, and push the limits of your creativity. There is no rush, so you can set and tackle tasks at your own pace. Experiment, adjust, and keep building. Through intelligence, resilience &amp; smart engineering, you will carve order from chaos and forge humanity\u2019s path to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/Wishlist-GIF-Exo-3.gif?t=1746754530\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3144430?t=1746754530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/0a162436773839178c5bb9bbd758126e8e077582/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746754530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/81871611705efef1355bafc0d5aebceb655f19e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746754530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/81871611705efef1355bafc0d5aebceb655f19e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746754530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3698690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are humanities new hope, sent out alone to the farthest reaches of outer space in order to build a warp gate that will pave the way to the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/01.gif?t=1746754530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/Salvage_1.png?t=1746754530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a lone engineer find, extract, move and utilize the abundant resources of a massive asteroid to build for humanity\u2019s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft basic tools and equipment from rocks and ice, and advance through the asteroid to get even stronger minerals to build better machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your workflow through automation and maximize your production. Building supply roads and assembly lines will help your resources reach your base faster and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/03.gif?t=1746754530\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/zerog_1.png?t=1746754530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All mining and logistics happen while utilizing zero-G newtonian physics. Bring order into the chaos of space by applying the laws of physics to work in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the laser and vacuum to break rocks and collect resources manually, or create huge automation highways back to your base with drones and accelerators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/02.gif?t=1746754530\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/problem_1.png?t=1746754530\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every success brings new challenges with it that have to be overcome. Higher output demands smarter logistics, and every solution is a new opportunity to tinker, optimize, and push the limits of your creativity. There is no rush, so you can set and tackle tasks at your own pace. Experiment, adjust, and keep building. Through intelligence, resilience &amp; smart engineering, you will carve order from chaos and forge humanity\u2019s path to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/Wishlist-GIF-Exo-3.gif?t=1746754530\" /></p>","developers":["ByteRockers' Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/f97d0cc25507e176c9e1d792679aef365a5a2871/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1746754530","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright ByteRockers' Games GmbH & Co. KG. All rights reserved. ByteRockers Games is a trademark registered in Germany and the USA.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130979,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130979/movie480.mp4?t=1746434920","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130979/movie_max.mp4?t=1746434920"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130979/a5a3f8e68c962f8cb81972160a4e5d8891e3983d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746434920","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130979/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746434920","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130979/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746434920"}}],"name":"Exovia","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5 4570 (or quad-core equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GTX 97